# Context7 (required for third-party code)

When a task involves external libraries, frameworks, APIs, or setup:

1. Resolve library ID via Context7 (`resolve-library-id`).
2. Fetch current docs (`get-library-docs`) before proposing code.
3. Prefer official, version-specific docs when a version is known.
4. Do not guess APIs — base decisions on fetched documentation.

Applies to `apps/backend` and `apps/frontend` dependency work.

Expo: also read https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v56.0.0/ before frontend changes.
